sting  transactions  yeah so you can post block people from  posting transactions it might even  decide to only post empty blocks  blocks that only contain the coinbase  and essentially kind of block the system  from making any progress because no  longer legitimate transactions are not  getting through so simple attacks are  kind of a real problem and it's  something that we have to defend defend  against when we define design these  blockchains  okay yeah and as it turns out by the way  if you have a majority of miners it  turns out in some designs you can even  revert some transactions which is kind  of countered to the persistence property  that blockchains are trying to provide

